>Heat illness quick card
Move to shade, remove excess clothes, cool with water and fan.
Confusion, collapse, seizure or failure to improve after 30 minutes of cooling: call emergency services and keep cooling. Offer cool drinks only if fully alert and able to swallow. If unresponsive and not breathing normally, start CPR.

